    "body": "The proposed disconnect option would also be useful to me — and a `flush()` method even moreso, for the reasons @WebReflection described. Every time I’ve ever used `takeRecords()`, it was specifically to do what `flush()` would do, and its absence presently necessitates keeping a common function reference around for both scenarios, which has seemed like awkward boilerplate.\r\n\r\n(And yep: I’d also love an unobserve-specific-node-only method — though I imagine that would probably merit its own issue.)",
